  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nHow many shrimp can Emily peel and saute in ten minutes? Emily can peel 7 shrimp per minute. Emily has 100 unpeeled shrimp available. Emily works continuously for the entire ten-minute period.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 6; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nHow many shrimp can Emily peel and saute in ten minutes? Emily can peel 7 shrimp per minute. Emily has 100 unpeeled shrimp available. Emily works continuously for the entire ten-minute period.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. Emily can peel 6 shrimp per minute.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Okay, now let me ask about just one part of that. How many shrimp can Emily peel in ten minutes? Additionally, Emily discards 5 shrimp after peeling them because they are damaged.\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"I should also tell you: Emily can saute 30 shrimp in 12 minutes.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"Actually, that was wrong. Emily can saute 30 shrimp in 10 minutes.\"},{\"turn\":6,\"user_message\":\"Here's another detail: Emily peels and sautes each shrimp sequentially rather than simultaneously.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Got it. But now I only need to know about: How long will it take Emily to peel and cook the shrimp? By the way, Emily needs to peel and cook 90 shrimp.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Emily needs to peel 95 shrimp because 5 are discarded, leaving 90 to cook.\n\n- Peeling time: \\(\\frac{95}{6}=15\\frac{5}{6}\\) minutes\n- Cooking rate: \\(\\frac{30}{10}=3\\) shrimp per minute\n- Cooking time: \\(\\frac{90}{3}=30\\) minutes\n\nSince she peels and cooks sequentially:\n\n\\[\n15\\frac{5}{6}+30=45\\frac{5}{6}\\text{ minutes}\n\\]\n\nThus, it will take \\(\\boxed{45\\frac{5}{6}\\text{ minutes}}\\), or \\(\\boxed{45\\text{ minutes }50\\text{ seconds}}\\).",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
